  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 703.04 Rescission of Authority.\n\n(a) Upon receipt of the notice of termination, the commissioner shall:\n\n(1) Rescind the former officer's commission; and\n\n(2) Give notice to the former officer thereof.\n\n(b) The former officer shall return the certificate of commission to the department within 7 days.\n\nSource. #2281, eff 1-16-83; ss by #2790, eff 8-2-84; ss by #5067, eff 2-21-91; ss by #6456, INTERIM, eff 2-21-97, EXPIRED: 6-21-97; ss by #6473, eff 3-25-97, EXPIRED: 3-25-05\n\nNew. #8776, eff 12-23-06; ss by #10889, eff 7-16-15",
